Z||000005||Elvira||06-20-2001||10:06 AM||||Rob and mine both have working a/c (well mine right now).  Rob's was already converted over before we bought it, but when the new motor went in, the new headers made it impossible to connect the lines to the compressor.  We have to have custom lines made so we can get the a/c back.  Mine works great though, hehehe.  I can't wait to get it on the road!  Then we start on project #3, our 86 t-top coupe with 56k miles on it.<P>------------------<BR>Elvira<P>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles||||reg||1
